+none (box) & 10/60 & 0 \\
+dense MLP outputs, all 18 layers & 59/60 & 1.02 {[}0.95, 1.16{]} \\
+dense MLP outputs, layers 0--13 & 58/60 & 1.00 {[}0.93, 1.14{]} \\
+100 selective transcoder features & 10/60 & 0.00 \\
+300 attribution-ranked features & 18/60 & 0.17 {[}0.04, 0.36{]} \\
